  ],
  "description": "Engaged non-Deluxe 9 V SAD1024 Electric Mistress. Original component values follow the 9 V circuit recorded in the November 2005 revision 2 Tonepad reference. Includes the 4558 audio stages, separate wet/dry weighting, frequency-shaped feedback and LM324 oscillator/range amplifier with a ganged Filter Matrix switch. The BBD is the shared delay of the parallel 512-stage paths. A calibrated period law replaces the LM311/CD4013 ultrasonic clock. Separate phase clock feedthrough and bypass contacts are omitted. A 33 nF comparator compensation capacitor, a timing seed and high-value DC paths aid initialization.",
  "io": {
    "groundNode": "0",
    "inputNode": "in",
    "outputNode": "out"
  },
  "layout": {
    "pots": [
      "VR4",
      "VR5",
      "VR3"
    ],
    "switches": [
      "Filter Matrix"
    ]
  },
  "name": "EHX Electric Mistress 9V",
